/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301
/favicon.ico /favicon.svg 301

# English is served from the apex (hreflang `en` -> `/`), there is no `/en/`
# prefix on this site. Crawlers and answer engines guess it anyway, which
# surfaces as 404s in Search Console - fold it back to the apex equivalent.
/en / 301
/en/* /:splat 301

# Canonical domain: https + non-www, single-hop only.
# www (https) is handled here in one hop. Plain-http (apex + www) is handled
# by functions/_middleware.js which upgrades protocol + strips www together,
# so http://www.* never chains via https://www.*. Do NOT re-add http:// rules
# here — duplicates caused the Ahrefs "Redirect chain" (http www -> https www
# -> https apex = 2 hops). Cloudflare "Always Use HTTPS" is the final backstop.
https://www.realdecibelmeter.com/* https://realdecibelmeter.com/:splat 301!
